    {
      "name": "Clone Field",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "yDDtGjX5XGhGbmut",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
         "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>Due to the shifting duplicates surrounding the wearer, they may re-roll one failed Dodge Test per Round while the clone field is active, and they may make a single additional Dodge Test each round that does not expend one of their available Reactions. Further, the wearer doubles all Success Levels on successful Dodge Tests. A clone field cannot be used to evade the attacks of creatures that do not rely on sight as a primary sense. Clone fields do not provide direct protection, and thus do not overload.</p>"
        },
